                "text": "Use $A\\cos(\\omega t+\\phi)=\\frac{A}{2}e^{j\\phi}e^{j\\omega t}+\\frac{A}{2}e^{-j\\phi}e^{-j\\omega t}$. Here $A=4$, $\\omega=5$, and $\\phi=\\pi/3$, so the coefficients are $2e^{j\\pi/3}$ and $2e^{-j\\pi/3}$.",
